config BR2_PACKAGE_WSPRD
	bool "wsprd"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_FFTW
	select BR2_PACKAGE_FFTW_SINGLE
	help
	  The WSPR decoder the radio reads the amateur bands' two-minute
	  propagation beacons with: K9AN and K1JT's wsprd, from WSJT-X
	  (a WAV file in, the spots out). The last version that is all C.

	  https://sourceforge.net/projects/wsjt/
